UVIS_030ST_URALPVIR001_PRIME"
NOTE                            =  "
 These data are rebinned to constant intervals of 01 km in ring plane
 radius from data acquired at 1, 2, 4, or 8 ms integration times. All
 event times including START_TIME, STOP_TIME, and the corresponding
 SPACECRAFT_CLOCK_START_COUNT/SPACECRAFT_STOP_COUNT are determined at the
 midpoint of each radial bin. Thus, the START_TIME and STOP_TIME and the
 corresponding SPACECRAFT_CLOCK_START_COUNT/SPACECRAFT_CLOCK_STOP_COUNT
 do not match those of the unbinned data or those of the data binned
 to a different radial resolution.

 For HIGHEST_DETECTABLE_OPACITY and LOWEST_DETECTABLE_OPACITY, -1.0 indicates
 the signal was too poor to allow the calculation of the value."

OBSERVATION_TYPE                = OCCULTATION_PROFILE
